    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_first_00",
      "hash64": "83057B573CDDB354",
      "text": "小生乃橘子學院美術老師……\\n寶可夢聯盟四天王，名為八朔。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_first_00b",
      "hash64": "8003CB3C6CB784C2",
      "text": "小生乃葡萄學院美術老師……\\n寶可夢聯盟四天王，名為八朔。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_first_01",
      "hash64": "83057C573CDDB507",
      "text": "藍莓學園的各位同學，\\n請多指教是也。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_00",
      "hash64": "7FA3DC75249E8F18",
      "text": "哎呀，原來是[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學\\n邀請小生過來的啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_01",
      "hash64": "7FA3DD75249E90CB",
      "text": "才一段時日不見，\\n[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳就已能挑起這樣的重責大任……！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 9,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_02",
      "hash64": "7FA3DE75249E927E",
      "text": "小、小生……森森驚訝與感動，\\n真是無比感慨得……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_select_01",
      "hash64": "A58E6E02325D5B52",
      "text": "別哭！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_select_02",
      "hash64": "A58E6D02325D599F",
      "text": "八朔老師！！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_03",
      "hash64": "7FA3DF75249E9431",
      "text": "……簡直就要掉眼淚了，\\n但小生會咬牙忍住的是也。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp01_04",
      "hash64": "7FA3E075249E95E4",
      "text": "畢竟這樣是會嚇到\\n學園的各位同學的啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_00",
      "hash64": "ABAAE67B8608A4C7",
      "text": "沒想到小生竟然能獲得\\n在他校執教鞭的機會，\\r\\n真是叫人開心。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_01",
      "hash64": "ABAAE57B8608A314",
      "text": "對了，身為美術老師的小生\\n以及身為四天王的小生……\\r\\n這所學園期望的是哪個身分的小生呢？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 46,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_select_01",
      "hash64": "FAA7DBE6492B3173",
      "text": "美術老師！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_select_02",
      "hash64": "FAA7DCE6492B3326",
      "text": "四天王！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_02",
      "hash64": "ABAAE87B8608A82D",
      "text": "真是那樣的話就好了。\\n畢竟之前小生上了美術課時，\\r\\n同學們的反應不甚理想……\\r\\n是小生想太多了嗎？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_02b",
      "hash64": "BC1158E4C0B5FE3D",
      "text": "果然是那樣啊！\\c\\n畢竟之前小生上了美術課時，\\n同學們的反應不甚理想……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 7,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 37,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_03",
      "hash64": "ABAAE77B8608A67A",
      "text": "這麼說來，小生聽說過\\n藍莓學園很注重寶可夢對戰。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp02_04",
      "hash64": "ABAAE27B86089DFB",
      "text": "那麼下堂課就請圓陸鯊前輩\\n來為同學們上一堂實習課吧。\\r\\n感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的建言是也！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_00",
      "hash64": "035710832287CAF6",
      "text": "聽說在藍莓學園，\\n學生都是自動自發地參與著\\r\\n委員會和學園的營運啊！[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_01",
      "hash64": "035711832287CCA9",
      "text": "不愧是新的學園，\\n充滿了挑戰精神呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_02",
      "hash64": "03570E832287C790",
      "text": "話雖如此，從年少之時\\n就必須要扛起責任……\\c\\n小生個人對此事的看法\\n是多少有所保留的。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_select_01",
      "hash64": "8AFE44BFB460A738",
      "text": "為什麼呢？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_select_02",
      "hash64": "8AFE47BFB460AC51",
      "text": "也就是說……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_03",
      "hash64": "03570F832287C943",
      "text": "畢竟，盡情玩耍不需負任何責任，\\n這是小孩子才能擁有的特權啊。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_sp03_04",
      "hash64": "035714832287D1C2",
      "text": "就這個層面來說，\\n小生也很擔心[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 15,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_00",
      "hash64": "FBEC39A0F7DADC90",
      "text": "請[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳千萬要小心，\\n不要過度背負他人的期待喔。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 1,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_01",
      "hash64": "FBEC3AA0F7DADE43",
      "text": "失禮了……上了年紀後，\\n說話總是會像是在說教。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_02",
      "hash64": "FBEC3BA0F7DADFF6",
      "text": "好，讓我們換個心情！\\n和小生交換寶可夢如何？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 22,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_03",
      "hash64": "FBEC3CA0F7DAE1A9",
      "text": "真心地感謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳是也。\\n小生打算拿精挑細選過的凍脊龍來交換，\\r\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳呢？[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 5,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 34,
