    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_trade_01_04",
      "hash64": "FBEC3DA0F7DAE35C",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0101(0001)]啊……\\n很有[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳的風格呢。\\c\\n今後就讓小生來\\n無微不至的培育牠吧。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
