      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_battleend_win_00_01",
      "hash64": "7E8DF306A5F4212A",
      "text": "而那份實力在今日卻是\\n如此地……堅不可摧……[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
