      "ordinal": 46,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_battleend_win_01_00",
      "hash64": "D4F39E0E415DACEC",
      "text": "謝謝[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳與小生交手。\\c\\n請讓小生頒授巨龍獎\\n給奮力對戰的[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳吧。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
