    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_battleend_win_01_01",
      "hash64": "D4F39F0E415DAE9F",
      "text": "如果[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳覺得能從小生身上學到些什麼，\\n就讓我們下次再來交手吧。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
