    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_battleend_lose_00_00",
      "hash64": "92A632C7CDBF57F0",
      "text": "這次就由小生摘下勝利了。\\c\\n但就剛才的對戰過程來看……\\n下次的結果就不得而知了。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
