        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_randomtalk_02",
      "hash64": "F7321A89F9C62349",
      "text": "小生曾經在釀光市的\\n大螢幕上看到阿寇。\\c\\n見到朋友努力的樣子，\\n會令人感到非常喜悅呢。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0012"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_randomtalk_03",
      "hash64": "F7321989F9C62196",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]同學[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳交換給我的\\n[VAR 0x0101(0001)]是個很棒的孩子呢。\\c\\n牠會主動來當小生作畫時的模特兒。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
