      "ordinal": 53,
      "label": "coach_teacher_dragon_randomtalk_04",
      "hash64": "F7321C89F9C626AF",
      "text": "凍脊龍過得還好嗎？\\c\\n牠很喜歡被摸肚子，\\n偶爾幫牠搓搓揉揉，牠會很開心的。[VAR 0x0114(0012)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
